    "text": "These former Central Ohio area high school standouts will be active on Saturday, Dec. 13.\nJason Moore\nAshland Eagles\nForward\nSophomore\n6′8″\nMarysville High School\nHometown: Marysville\nNext Game: vs. Thomas More Saints, Saturday, Dec. 13, 3 p.m.\nNick Kessler\nIllinois State Redbirds\nSenior\n6′6″ 265\nMarysville High School\nHometown: Marysville\nNext Game: vs. UC Davis Aggies, Saturday, Dec. 13, 2 p.m.\nZion Crowe\nThomas More Saints\nGuard\nSophomore\n6′5″ 200\nShawnee High School\nHometown: Springfield\nNext Game: vs. Ashland Eagles, Saturday, Dec. 13, 3 p.m.",
